-      FMTCompileOld/42                        16.6 ns         16.6 ns     43278267
-      FMTCompileOld/273123                    18.7 ns         18.6 ns     37035861
-      FMTCompileOld/9223372036854775807       19.4 ns         19.4 ns     35243000
