+    However, if ``approx`` is set to 'precise' or 'fast' it applies
+
+    .. math::
+        \textrm{GELUApprox}(x) &= 0.5 * x * \left(1 + \text{Tanh}\left(\sqrt{2 / \pi} * \left(x + 0.044715 * x^3\right)\right)\right) \\
+        \textrm{GELUFast}(x) &= x * \sigma\left(1.702 * x\right)
