+      R"pbdoc(
+      Type to hold categories of :class:`dtypes <Dtype>`.
+
+      * :attr:`~mlx.core.generic`
+
+        * :ref:`bool_ <data_types>`
+        * :attr:`~mlx.core.number`
+
